{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33750","headline":"七爱诗 元鲁山 · 皮日休","name":"七爱诗 元鲁山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾爱元紫芝，清介如伯夷。\n辇母远之官，宰邑无玷疵。\n三年鲁山民，丰稔不暂饥。\n三年鲁山吏，清慎各自持。\n只饮鲁山泉，只采鲁山薇。\n一室冰檗苦，四远声光飞。\n退归旧隐来，斗酒入茅茨。\n鸡黍匪家畜，琴尊常自怡。\n尽日一菜食，穷年一布衣。\n清似匣中镜，直如琴上丝。\n世无用贤人，青山生白髭。\n既卧黔娄衾，空立陈寔碑。\n吾无鲁山道，空有鲁山辞。\n所恨不相识，援毫空涕垂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}